sequenceDiagram
  actor Cliente
  participant OS as OS Service
  participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
  participant Billing as Billing Service

  Cliente->>OS: POST aprovar-orcamento aprovado=false
  OS->>OS: Marca FALHA_COMPENSADA / saga COMPENSATING
  OS->>RMQ: compensar.orcamento
  OS->>RMQ: compensar.pagamento
  RMQ->>Billing: cancela orcamento/pagamento
  Billing->>Billing: status CANCELADO no MongoDB
  OS->>OS: saga COMPENSATED
